      "stem": "`Foo` has methods `read()` and `write(String input)`. What does the test class below illustrate?\n\n```\nclass FooTest {\n    @Test\n    void read() { ... }\n    @Test\n    void write_emptyInput_exceptionThrown() { ... }\n    @Test\n    void write_normalInput_writtenCorrectly() { ... }\n}\n```",
