      "stem": "In the pseudocode below, statements A to D are the happy path inside the loop. Which change reduces their nesting?\n\n```\nfor (condition1)\n    if (condition2)\n        statement A\n        statement B\n        statement C\n        statement D\nstatement E\n```",
