      "basis": "bold",
      "ab3": [],
      "stem": "A developer misremembers that list indices start at `1`, so the loop in `sumPrices()` starts counting from the wrong index. Later the screen shows a total that is too small. In the course's terminology, what is the loop that starts counting from the wrong index?",
