      "stem": "AB3 splits command parsing across classes: `ArgumentTokenizer` breaks the argument string up by prefixes, `ParserUtil` converts strings into model types such as `Name` and `Phone`, and each `XYZCommandParser` builds one kind of command. Which design quality does this division mainly serve?",
