      "ab3": [],
      "stem": "`Payroll` uses a `SalaryManager`. A test calls `payroll.setSalaryManager(new SalaryManagerStub())`, where `SalaryManagerStub extends SalaryManager` and returns hard-coded salaries. Which OOP mechanism makes this substitution work?",
